 o add\, and your own safety gloves if needed. Fresh made apple cider\, co
 okies and new merch available to purchase. Free harvest swap table and fr
 ee harvests from the garden. All ages\, everyone is welcome. The garden i
 s on private property\, so please come only during event hours.\nhttps://
 neighborhood-harvest.org
